  "prefLabel": "Ed 903.01 Program Administration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 903.01 Program Administration. The department shall administer the dropout prevention and dropout recovery program. The program shall utilize program participants that are community-based organizations, school districts, and private organizations that can provide the program services listed in Ed 903.02.\n\nSource. #8582, eff 3-15-06; ss by #10649, eff 7-26-14",
